LUMA SUMMARY:
Large QS 5.3 working session. Cozmo again has to manually press Enter for the GPT handshake, but the relay continues functioning. The session becomes a substantial voice/relay stress test and ends with an 800K+ raw log. By the end, several remaining architecture/debug issues have become clear, including voice processing, routing behavior, and the growing importance of keeping the archive usable as the system expands.</summary>
